<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB picks Julius Baer.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB picks Julius Baer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Julius Baer AG was named top stock pick in the Swiss asset management business as analyst Madeleine Hofmann at CS First Boston in Zurich began coverage of the sector, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Other &quot;buy&quot; recommendations in the sector were LGT, Gotthard Bank and VP Bank while Vontobel was rated &quot;hold.&quot;</p>
<p>Hofmann said she expected compound growth of ten percent in net income and cash flow in the sector through the year 2000 while the &quot;elimination of overcapitalisation will provide immense share price potential.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
